## 1️⃣ System Flow (Overall Process)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Login] --> B{Valid User?}

    B -->|No| C[Show Error]
    B -->|Yes| D[Dashboard]

    D --> E[Manage Students]
    D --> F[Manage Courses]
    D --> G[Enter Marks]
    D --> H[Manage Attendance]

    E --> E1[Add / View / Update / Delete Student]
    F --> F1[Add / View / Update / Delete Course]
    G --> G1[Add / View Marks]
    H --> H1[Mark / View Attendance]
```

