## 6️⃣ Backend Sequence Diagram (Add Marks Flow)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Teacher
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    T->>UI: Enter student marks
    UI->>API: POST /marks
    API->>DB: Save marks
    DB-->>API: Success
    API-->>UI: Response OK
    UI-->>T: Show success message
```

