## 🔟 Frontend State Flow (Marks Entry Example)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Editing : Teacher inputs marks
    Editing --> Submitting : Click submit
    Submitting --> Success : API OK
    Submitting --> Error : API Failed
    Error --> Editing : Retry
    Success --> Idle : Reset form
```

